   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ADT401 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.6</span>\n<h2>Student tasks & constructive questions</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">The rules you are held to (attendance, preparation, exam eligibility) — verbatim.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13377 · Decision 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 22/08/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ADT401 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.6</span>\n<h2>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên & câu hỏi kiến tạo</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Những quy định bạn phải tuân theo (chuyên cần, chuẩn bị bài, điều kiện dự thi) — nguyên văn.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13377 · QĐ 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 22/08/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student tasks (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>- Attend at least 80% of contact hours in order to be accepted to the final examination<br>- Follow instructions from teachers in class<br>- Actively participate in class activities<br>- Fulfill tasks given by instructor after class<br>- Read the textbook in advance<br>- Access the course website (www.cms.fpt.edu.vn) for up-to-date information and material of the course, for online supports from teachers and other students and for practicing and assessment.<br>- Complete course's Portfolio with full contents of exercises and submit to the teacher 1 day after the course</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>- Attend at least 80% of contact hours in order to be accepted to the final examination<br>- Follow instructions from teachers in class<br>- Actively participate in class activities<br>- Fulfill tasks given by instructor after class<br>- Read the textbook in advance<br>- Access the course website (www.cms.fpt.edu.vn) for up-to-date information and material of the course, for online supports from teachers and other students and for practicing and assessment.<br>- Complete course's Portfolio with full contents of exercises and submit to the teacher 1 day after the course</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions (31)</h3>\n<p>Questions the syllabus asks you to think through before or during the session — try answering them yourself first.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo (31)</h3>\n<p>Câu hỏi syllabus yêu cầu bạn suy nghĩ trước/trong buổi học — tự trả lời trước khi xem bài.</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>Session<br><small>Buổi</small></th><th>Code<br><small>Mã</small></th><th>Question (verbatim)<br><small>Câu hỏi (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td>QN1</td><td>In yỏur point of view, what is the interaction design?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td>QN1</td><td>What are the differences between design-led and user-led?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td>QN1</td><td>Why we should use user-led in making product from scratch?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td>QN1</td><td>What is your design process that you will follow in order to run your project?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td>QN1</td><td>What is your design process that you will follow in order to run your project?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td>QN1</td><td>What is your design process that you will follow in order to run your project?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>9</td><td>QN1</td><td>What are the similarities/differences between user experience and game feeling?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>10</td><td>QN1</td><td>What is the user-flow for a digital game?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>11</td><td>QN1</td><td>What is the user-flow for a digital game?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>12</td><td>QN1</td><td>What is your game idea? Sketch several screens to show the main flow of it?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>13</td><td>QN1</td><td>What is your game idea? Sketch several screens to show the main flow of it?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>14</td><td>QN1</td><td>What kind of typo and branding you will use for your game idea? Provide several hifi based on the screen flow above?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>15</td><td>QN1</td><td>How to conduct a digital technology product analysis?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>16</td><td>QN1</td><td>How can you apply sensemaking process to build your wireframe?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>17</td><td>QN1</td><td>How to design a product focusing on social issue?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>24</td><td>QN1</td><td>What can you do to improve your hifi supporting disable people?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>25</td><td>QN1</td><td>What is your approach for developing your idea?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>26</td><td>QN1</td><td>What are your product continuous experience?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>30</td><td>QN1</td><td>What are the limitation of your wireframe? How can you improve it?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>31</td><td>QN1</td><td>What are the limitation of your wireframe? How can you improve it?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>33</td><td>QN1</td><td>What are the limitation of your wireframe? How can you improve it?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>34</td><td>QN1</td><td>What are the limitation of your wireframe? How can you improve it?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>45</td><td>QN1</td><td>What are your test methods? Please provide the criteria with the test plans?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>46</td><td>QN1</td><td>What are your test methods? Please provide the criteria with the test plans?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>49</td><td>QN1</td><td>What are your test methods? Please provide the criteria with the test plans?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>52</td><td>QN1</td><td>What is your project branding and typography? How can it make user feel better?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>53</td><td>QN1</td><td>What is your project branding and typography? How can it make user feel better?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>54</td><td>QN1</td><td>What is your project branding and typography? How can it make user feel better?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>60</td><td>QN1</td><td>What make your idea stand out comparing to your teammate's hifi and actual products in the market?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>60</td><td>QN2</td><td>What make your idea stand out comparing to your teammate's hifi and actual products in the market?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>60</td><td>QN3</td><td>What make your idea stand out comparing to your teammate's hifi and actual products in the market?</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13377\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13377</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13377\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13377</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
